      ":question/problem": "![](images/62/62693739e0de838cb2666867d1174cc4a24210af6cef0cb8f296a690cc23ada2.png)\n\nTriangles $ABC$ and $DEF$ each have a side measuring $2$ and a side measuring $4$, as shown above. Which of the following additional pieces of information is sufficient to prove that these triangles are congruent?\n\n1. The measures of $\u2220B$ and $\u2220E$ are equal.\n2. The measures of $\u2220A$ and $\u2220D$ are equal.\n3. The measure of $\u2220C$ is $50^{\u2218}$.\n4. No additional information is needed.\n\n*(Note: Images not drawn to scale)*"
